[statement]
A character device of numbers 1,3 whose pax `SCHILY.devmajor` record is not
a number. bsdtar lists 0,0; GNU tar, Python and Go read 1,3. ferrotape
refuses it, at both levels.

[archive]
pax SCHILY.devmajor=abc
header name=c typeflag=3 devmajor=1 devminor=3
header name=after
data "y"
end

